"Shows the glow and plays the sound once, as at the end of a session." = "像专注结束时那样，显示一次光晕并播放一次提示音。";
"Shows the plain display for a while: color and no added warmth. Night Shift is left alone. Your settings and exceptions are kept." = "暂时显示无滤镜画面：彩色且不叠加暖色。夜览不受影响。设置和单独设置都会保留。";
"Shows the supported browsers that are not installed on this Mac." = "显示这台 Mac 上未安装的受支持浏览器。";
