"Start a session from the menu: a stretch of focused work with a gentle end. The icon shows the minutes left. At the end, a warm glow and a soft gong, nothing to dismiss, and the count goes on so you can see how far you stretch. When you leave, it can call you back once." = "从菜单开始专注时段：一段温和收尾的专注工作。图标显示剩余分钟。结束时有温暖的光晕和轻柔的锣声，无需关闭任何东西，计数继续，让你看到自己延长了多久。你离开时，它可以唤回你一次。";
