"The extension reads the address and title of your tabs, so Less Pull knows which website is in front. Your browser will call this “browsing history”.\n\nIt cannot read or change what is on a page, see what you type, or reach your passwords, cookies or forms. It has no buttons and no network connection of its own; it talks only to the Less Pull app on this Mac. Private tabs are never reported.\n\nWhat is kept: only the website exceptions you save, on this Mac. The address of the site in front is held in memory, never written to disk, overwritten by the next one, and dropped when the browser disconnects or stops reporting." = "扩展读取标签页的地址和标题，好让 Less Pull 知道哪个网站在前台。浏览器会把这称为“浏览历史记录”。\n\n它不能读取或更改页面内容，看不到你输入的内容，也接触不到你的密码、Cookie 或表单。它没有按钮，也没有自己的网络连接；只与这台 Mac 上的 Less Pull 应用通信。无痕标签页从不上报。\n\n保留的内容：只有你保存的网站单独设置，存放在这台 Mac 上。前台网站的地址只保存在内存中，从不写入磁盘，会被下一个覆盖，并在浏览器断开或停止上报时丢弃。";
