"A Control-click or a two-finger tap on the trackpad counts as a right-click. One of the two always opens the menu. Opens the session panel starts a session, or opens the panel of the one running. Once a session is over, the two trade places: the menu button opens the session panel and the session button opens the menu." = "按住 Control 点按或触控板双指轻点算作右键点按。两个按键中总有一个打开菜单。“打开专注面板”会开始专注，或打开正在进行的专注面板。专注结束后两者互换：菜单键打开专注面板，专注键打开菜单。";
"What this display shows. Follows what is on it: the app in front, or the app on top here, or your defaults. Always your defaults: exceptions never apply here. Always plain: never grayscale or warmth here." = "这台显示器显示什么。“跟随其上内容”：前台应用，或在这里最靠前的应用，或你的默认设置。“始终用默认设置”：单独设置在这里从不生效。“始终无滤镜”：这里从不使用灰度或暖色。";
"Which displays Peek toggles while this app is in front: the display under the pointer, all displays, or any set of connected displays you tick. Works whether or not the exception is used." = "此应用在前台时，一瞥切换哪些显示器：指针所在的显示器、所有显示器，或你勾选的任意已连接显示器。无论单独设置是否启用都有效。";
