"While a session runs, a click on the icon opens the session panel; the other mouse button opens the menu. Once the session is over, the two trade places, so a click reaches the panel with Keep going and Leave quietly. The Peek and Toggle shortcuts keep working." = "专注进行时，点按图标会打开专注面板；另一个鼠标键打开菜单。专注结束后两者互换，点按一下就能到达带有“继续”和“就这样”的面板。“一瞥”和切换快捷键继续有效。";
