"You have %@.\n\n%@\n\nInstalling is still by hand: download the new version, quit Less Pull, and replace it in Applications. Your settings and exceptions are kept." = "你当前的版本是 %@。\n\n%@\n\n安装仍需手动：下载新版本，退出 Less Pull，然后在“应用程序”文件夹中替换它。设置和单独设置都会保留。";
